Description: MDEON — Minimal Desktop Environment, Optimized for Needs
 MDEON provides a lightweight, modular desktop environment setup
 supporting both X11 and Wayland minimal sessions with Cairo-rendered tools.
 .
 This package replaces the minimal-session-common, minimal-wayland-session,
 and minimal-x-session packages.
